%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'themeVariables': {'background':'#ffffff'}}}%%
classDiagram
    direction LR
    class SecureEnvelope {
        wire 信封: BATCH/DATAGRAM 的 Payload 实际是这个
        FlagEnvelope 置位时帧 Payload = 编码后的 SecureEnvelope
        双层完整性: 传输层 AEAD + 应用层 HMAC (MAC 字段)
    }

    class Metadata {
        元数据 (明文 / 协商参数)
        ──────────────────────────
        EnvelopeVersion uint32
        MessageType     EnvelopeMsgType
        SessionId       []byte
        KeyId           []byte
        Seq             uint64  (仅 reliable BATCH)
        ChunkId         []byte  (ULID 16B, 仅 reliable)
        CreatedAtUnixMs int64
        Codec           Codec       (协商结果)
        Compression     Compression (协商结果)
        CipherSuite     CipherSuite (协商结果)
        DeliveryMode    DeliveryMode
    }

    class Crypto {
        加密载荷 + 认证
        ──────────────────────────
        Nonce   []byte  显式 nonce, 同密钥下禁止复用
        Payload []byte  压缩后→加密后的密文
        MAC     []byte  HMAC 输出 (canonicalMAC over header+payload)
    }

    class CodecEnum {
        Codec (协商)
        0 UNSPECIFIED
        1 PROTO  (baseline 默认)
        2 CBOR   (constrained)
        3 JSON   (仅调试)
    }
    class CompEnum {
        Compression (协商)
        0 UNSPECIFIED
        1 ZSTD (baseline 默认)
        2 LZ4  (constrained / 低延迟)
        3 NONE
        4 GZIP (legacy)
    }
    class CipherEnum {
        CipherSuite (跟随 binding 合规语境 §8.3)
        0 UNSPECIFIED
        1 INTL  SHA-256 + AES-256-GCM + ECDSA/Ed25519
        2 GM    SM3 + SM4-GCM + SM2  (国密 / TLCP)
    }

    SecureEnvelope --> Metadata : 字段 1–11
    SecureEnvelope --> Crypto : 字段 12–14
    Metadata ..> CodecEnum : Codec
    Metadata ..> CompEnum : Compression
    Metadata ..> CipherEnum : CipherSuite

    note for SecureEnvelope "校验顺序 (handler_batch.go):<br/>① 先 HMAC (Open 内 VerifyMAC)<br/>② 后算法一致性复核 (verifyEnvelopeAlgo)<br/>未认证方注入帧无法探测协商算法集"
